     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">forwarded from Karen</span><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"> Ng:</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Hi all,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">A couple of the DSI affiliates will gather for a mini hack day to work on</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">some short data science projects this friday.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">We will learn from each other and see if we can form teams</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">to work on the same project(s).</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Venue: the DSI space on the 3rd floor of the Shields library (link to directions)</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Date: this Friday 09/09/2016</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Time: 9:30 am - 5:00 pm This is flexible and you do not have to stay the entire time.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">See our proposed schedule (link) for that day.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">You can check out the list of proposed projects at:</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki#project-list\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki%23project-list&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467220251000&amp;usg=AOvVaw33Dl9cr7HtNz1gfVUJVmXv\">https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki#project-list</a><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">If you plan on participating in someone &#39;s project / suggesting your own project,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">please take 5 mins to fill out a brief description in the project table on the GitHub wiki</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">(you will need to sign into your GitHub account, then click the &quot;Edit&quot; button on the upper right-hand corner):</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki#project-list\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki%23project-list&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467220251000&amp;usg=AOvVaw33Dl9cr7HtNz1gfVUJVmXv\">https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki#project-list</a><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">and tell us a bit about your background at:</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki#organizer--participants-bio\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki%23organizer--participants-bio&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467220251000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tqbvZrJhFNx6g_HpnEbyU\">https://github.com/ucdavis/DSI-2016-summer-hackday/wiki#organizer--participants-bio</a><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Or you can email us your project description and personal bio.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Look forward to hearing about your projects / hacking on the projects with you.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Cheers,</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:&quot;helvetica neue&quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px\">Karen</span><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">-- <br></div><div data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Myfanwy Johnston<div>Ph.D Candidate, UC Davis</div><div>Animal Behavior Graduate Group</div><div>Biotelemetry Laboratory</div></div></div>\r\n"
